Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.22,0:01:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I lay under the moon\N♪ 有时我躺在月光下 ♪  
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.00,0:01:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And thank God I'm breathing\N♪ 感谢上帝让我还能呼吸 ♪  
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.84,0:01:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I pray\N♪ 然后我祈祷 ♪  
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.40,0:01:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take me soon\N♪ 不要太早带走我 ♪  
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.12,0:01:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause I am here for a reason\N♪ 因为我来到这里是有原因 ♪  
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.06,0:01:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes in my tears I drown\N♪ 有时我眼泪落下来 ♪  
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.08,0:01:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But I never let it get me down\N♪ 但我从未让它使我消沉 ♪  
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.60,0:01:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So when negativity surrounds\N♪ 所以当消极情绪围绕我时 ♪  
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.04,0:01:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I know some day it'll all turn around because...\N♪ 我知道有一天一切都会好转，因为... ♪  
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.99,0:01:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All my life I've been waiting for\N♪ 我的一生都在等待 ♪  
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.10,0:01:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been praying for\N♪ 我一直在祈祷 ♪  
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.80,0:01:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,For the people to say\N♪ 人们会说 ♪  
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.80,0:01:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That we don't wanna fight no more\N♪ 我们不想再打仗了 ♪  
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.04,0:01:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There will be no more wars\N♪ 将不再有战争 ♪  
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.24,0:01:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And our children will play\N♪ 我们的孩子将自由玩耍 ♪  
