Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.24,0:02:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,One day this all will change\N♪ 有一天这一切都会改变 ♪  
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.64,0:02:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Treat people the same\N♪ 以同样的方式对待他人 ♪  
